 GRADE approach to assess the certainty of evidence for outcomes related to the vaccine\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Pooled effectiveness estimates were calculated when multiple observational studies reported data on a specific outcome\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the Work Group used a modified GRADE approach to assess the certainty of evidence for outcomes related to the vaccine\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"based on outcomes that occurred ≥14 days after receipt of the second dose\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Based on VSD chart-reviewed cases of myocarditis and pericarditis that met CDC case definitions among persons aged 18–39 years after dose 2\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}